course: dictionary
lesson: 8428
title: The Sabbath: a special day of rest
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A word can be understood from the words around it. «The Sabbath is a day of rest and worship; most Christians keep Sunday, and Jews keep Saturday.» The clues rest and worship tell you it is a day to stop working and to pray or praise God.
explain: Look for more clues. «On the seventh day God rested and blessed the day; this is the root of the weekly day of rest, the Sabbath.» Seventh day and weekly tell you the Sabbath comes every week and is a day of rest.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. «Jews keep a day of rest on Saturday» still makes sense with the Sabbath in its place, so you have the right meaning.
explain: Some words come from the same root. A sabbatical is a long break from work to rest or study. If you know the Sabbath is a day of rest, sabbatical makes sense as a longer rest.
fact: The Sabbath is a weekly day of rest and worship.
fact: For Jews, the Sabbath runs from Friday evening to Saturday evening.
fact: Most Christians keep Sunday as the Lord's Day.
fact: «Shabbat» is the Jewish word for the Sabbath, with candles, a family meal and prayer.
fact: «Sabbatical» comes from the same root and means a long break from work to rest or study.
exercise: «The Sabbath is a day of rest and worship.» What is the Sabbath? | A day for shopping and sport only | A holiday that comes once a year | *A weekly day of rest and worship | A type of church building
exercise: «For Jews, the Sabbath lasts from Friday evening to Saturday evening.» When does the Jewish Sabbath end? | *Saturday evening | Sunday morning | Monday at midnight | Friday evening
exercise: «A sabbatical is a long break from work to rest or study.» Which word means a long break? | weekly | candles | worship | *sabbatical
test: «Bible stories show Jesus healing on the Sabbath and arguing about what rest means.» What does this suggest about the Sabbath rules? | *Rules are there to serve people | The Sabbath is only for Jewish families | Healing is banned on the Sabbath | Rules must never be bent
test: Which day do most Christians keep as the Lord's Day? | Saturday | Monday | Friday | *Sunday
exam: What is Shabbat? | A kind of bread baked on Friday | A long holiday abroad | *The Jewish Sabbath, with candles, a family meal and prayer | A Christian church in the city
